  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your deniable-contractor cover: <strong>\"freelance systems-exorcist / legacy-code consultant.\"</strong> On paper you clear haunted mainframes, purge orphaned processes, and decommission legacy systems too old and too tangled for anyone else to touch. Off paper, you talk to the net's dead - the sprites, the decommissioned ghosts, the code that refused to stop - because death recognizes death, and they come to you willingly.</p><p>The corps that hire you never ask how you do it, only that the haunted server farm is quiet by Monday. The street calls it what it is: a spirit-broker's trade, run by a man who is technically part of the inventory he's clearing.</p>",
